WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:21.632
Hello! Who are you?

2
00:00:21.633 --> 00:00:24.657
I'm a raccoon.

3
00:00:24.658 --> 00:00:28.553
Raccoons are small mammals.

4
00:00:28.554 --> 00:00:31.093
Where do you live?

5
00:00:31.094 --> 00:00:35.920
A lot of raccoons live in North America.

6
00:00:35.921 --> 00:00:41.651
We live in forests, marshes, and cities.

7
00:00:41.652 --> 00:00:46.393
We usually make dens high in trees.

8
00:00:46.394 --> 00:00:49.584
Are you wearing a mask?

9
00:00:49.585 --> 00:00:54.121
No, that's just my fur.

10
00:00:54.122 --> 00:00:58.952
We also have rings on our tails.

11
00:00:58.953 --> 00:01:02.189
What do you eat?

12
00:01:02.190 --> 00:01:06.716
Raccoons eat almost anything.

13
00:01:06.717 --> 00:01:13.948
We love fish, berries, mice, and frogs.

14
00:01:13.949 --> 00:01:18.337
Is it hard to find food in cities?

15
00:01:18.338 --> 00:01:22.025
Not for a raccoon!

16
00:01:22.026 --> 00:01:27.463
We find great food in garbage cans.

17
00:01:27.464 --> 00:01:31.419
You can open garbage cans?

18
00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:35.635
Our front paws are like your hands.

19
00:01:35.636 --> 00:01:40.340
We have five fingers on each paw.

20
00:01:40.341 --> 00:01:45.817
We can grab things and even open doors.

21
00:01:45.818 --> 00:01:49.726
Do you live with other raccoons?

22
00:01:49.727 --> 00:01:54.629
Yes, raccoons live in small groups.

23
00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:58.722
We sleep during the day.

24
00:01:58.723 --> 00:02:05.153
We look for food at night.

25
00:02:05.154 --> 00:02:10.177
Oh! I smell food in that garbage can.

26
00:02:10.178 --> 00:02:13.320
See you later.

27
00:02:13.321 --> 00:02:21.068
Good-bye, Raccoon!
